skinson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds complete-value regressions for existing public Core consumers: two financial Program/v1 serialization and reopening cases; a Core/2 invoice Program, stage plan and continuation roundtrip retaining a present zero duty; and a prefunded bilateral UTXO-pattern exchange. The exchange retains full authored wire assertions separately from independently frozen financial snapshots/effects and can capture the actual complete Execution before assertions.\n\nValidation: all four tests passed across the three exact mori-core targets with --frozen -j1 --no-default-features (26.816s cold wrapper, no filtered tests). The captured exchange matches the independent oracle across pre/post, all11complete snapshots, ordered per-step/cumulative effects and all6effects. Invoice finance and existing logical schedule were independently frozen before execution. Source/tree remained unchanged; process session empty and owned temporary target deleted.\n\nIndependent source/result review is pending. These checks select existing local Core consumers; compiler Artifact/SDK/native proof, the complete20UTXO families and target/ledger acceptance remain open. No production semantics, dependencies or lockfile changed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T13:20:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:59:58Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T13:59:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T13:59:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"049395532c43b17c54bdbc5a529535b521dc56df","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CharlesHoskinson:doctorwatson-language/core-consumer-roundtrips-20261018","ref":"doctorwatson-language/core-consumer-roundtrips-20261018","repo":{"id":1360485122,"node_id":"R_kgDOURdbAg","name":"Moriarty","full_name":"CharlesHoskinson/Moriarty","owner":{"login":"CharlesHoskinson","id":3279952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk5NTI=","avatar_url":"http